#only("3")[#voiceover("Active management, where managers actively pick stocks trying to beat the market, would not consistently outperform passive management, like simply investing in a market index fund.")]
#only("4")[#voiceover("Strategies like trying to time the market or pick individual stocks would not work in the long run, as the market is too efficient for these tactics according to EMH.")]
